  "steps": [
    "Blend soaked moong dal with curd into a smooth batter (add 1-2 tbsp water if needed).",
    "Mix in grated broccoli, salt, and cumin. Let it rest for 15-20 minutes to activate fermentation.",
    "Just before steaming, add eno and mix the batter gently.",
    "Grease the mold, pour in the batter and steam for 15-18 mins until fluffy (can also take a little longer).",
    "Let the idlis cool down a bit before demoulding or else they will stick.",
    "If they still stick to the mould, dip a spoon or knife in water and gently release the edges.",
    "Don’t overmix the batter.",
    "Add water ONLY if needed. Watery mixture can make idlis flat."
  ],
